      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777473499349,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is the bottleneck right then what is\nthis queue solving, so when the write\nrequests are more then 10k request per\nsecond what we need to do here , because\nusing queue will help in processing in\nsequence , or queue level serialization of\nthe request do not need db locks now, but\nthere is still this problem of the more then\n10k request ",
      "fontSize": 20.684554812158137,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is the bottleneck right then what is this queue solving, so when the write requests are more then 10k request per second what we need to do here , because using queue will help in processing in sequence , or queue level serialization of the request do not need db locks now, but there is still this problem of the more then 10k request ",
